sequenceDiagram
  actor U as User
  participant Web as Next.js
  participant API as Campaigns API
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant Q as BullMQ
  participant S as Sender Adapter
  U->>Web: Launch campaign
  Web->>API: POST /campaigns/:id/launch
  API->>DB: validate + status running
  API->>Q: enqueue schedule
  API-->>Web: 202
  Q->>API: worker schedule
  loop due steps
    API->>S: send or export
    S-->>API: provider id
    API->>DB: CampaignEvent
  end
  API-->>Web: SSE stats
